    <part id="architect-for-change">
      <title>Architect for Change</title>
      <slide id="toolbox">
        <title>Which Corner of the Garden Should You Focus on First?</title>
        <ul>
          <li>Where are you? How many APIs, how much pressure?</li>
          <li>What failures do you see? Exposure or what you expose?</li>
          <li>How big is your landscape going to be?</li>
          <li>What is on leadership's radar?</li>
        </ul>
      </slide>
      <slide id="toolbox-techniques">
        <title>A Starting Point: Five Techniques</title>
        <table style="border-collapse: collapse ; border: 2px solid #000000 ;">
          <tr>
            <th style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; background: #eeeeee ;">Technique</th>
            <th style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; background: #eeeeee ;">Effort</th>
            <th style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ; background: #eeeeee ;">What you get</th>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Check your APIs for AI readiness</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Easy</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Awareness, helps going forward</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Improve the descriptions</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Cheap, can be automated</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">A bit better</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Improve the API designs</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Varies, needs the API teams</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Better results, more effort</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Select or search the tools</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Select by hand, search, or both</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Not everything in the context</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Orchestrate tools into AI-friendly designs</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">Higher (Arazzo or other ways)</td>
            <td style="border: 2px solid #000000 ; padding: 10px 20px ;">High payback if it is easy to do</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </slide>
    </part>
    <part id="conclusions">
      <title>Conclusions</title>
      <slide id="lessons">
        <title>What Agents Are Teaching Us</title>
        <ul>
          <li>Integration problems did not go away, they moved from design time to runtime</li>
          <li>Watch your agents, and look into the traces</li>
          <li>Which parts need the runtime creativity of agents, which are fine with workflows? Architect so you can play with that line</li>
        </ul>
      </slide>
      <slide id="monday">
        <title>Monday Tasks: Triple A</title>
        <ul>
          <li>APIs: check and improve your API landscape</li>
          <li>Ambitions: find out what people want to do next with AI</li>
          <li>Actions: watch what your existing agents are doing</li>
        </ul>
